<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES SCORE 179 FOR NINE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES SCORE 179 FOR NINE.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies scored 179 for nine in 50 overs against Pakistan in the first match of the limited overs World Series final at the Sydney Cricket Ground on Saturday.</p>
<p>Score - West Indies 179 for nine in 50 overs (Sherwin Campbell 52, Waqar Younis four for 43) v Pakistan.</p>
